entries[1289728] = { ["name"] = "Holy Armaments", ["text"] = "Protection, Retribution\nWill the Light to coalesce and become manifest as a Holy Armament, wielded by your target.\n\nSacred Weapon :\n\nWhile wielding a Sacred Weapon, your spells and abilities have a chance to deal (104% of Attack Power) additional Holy damage or healing to nearby targets. Effect is increased when Sacred Weapon strikes a single target, and reduced above 5. Lasts 20 sec.\n\nBecomes Holy Bulwark after use.\n\nHoly\nWill the Light to coalesce and become manifest as a Holy Armament, wielded by your target.\n\nSacred Weapon :\n\nWhile wielding a Sacred Weapon, your spells and abilities have a chance to deal (104% of Attack Power) additional Holy damage or healing to nearby targets. Effect is increased when Sacred Weapon strikes a single target, and reduced above 5. Lasts 20 sec.\n\nBecomes Holy Bulwark after use.\n\nGenerates 3 Holy Power." }
